00312:         "exact_text": "| MECHANICS_GENERATION | ≥ 8 | 混乱 33%、怪力钳世代分支、压后单遍 |",
00313:         "atomic_dispute": "Only middle effect identity 怪力钳世代分支. Confusion33/currentquash stage supported and preserved. The actual generation8 versusolder contact reaction belongs KingsShield, while HyperCutter prevents external Attack loss via separate central immunity gate.",
00314:         "whole_formal_context": [
00315:           {
00316:             "label": "Complete purpose/scope/non-target subsection",
00317:             "repo": "/workspace/pokemon-essentials-clean-room",
