00384:         "whole_context_read": "Proposer actually read wholeWP40360 earlier; FULL is not a new global PASS. §5.3 names 王盾 contact counter; §10 is explicit config→affected-consumer table. WP48 correctly identifies HYPERCUTTER as Attack-loss prevention and is preserved."
